{"unit_id":"yoyococo1234__dsh-plugin-mcp-switch#card-zh","repo":"yoyococo1234/dsh-plugin-mcp-switch","commit":"40b349b49677cacb5f1c236427fa1471c26becd7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"MCP Switch 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 MCP 管理插件，默认让服务器保持断开，避免未使用的工具进入上下文。它在 agent 工具中提供服务器查询、连接、断开、新增、删除、策略设置和分组管理，并在设置页加入状态面板。用户可以查看已连接服务器的工具数量与估算上下文成本，选择启动时恢复上次状态或只连接标记为自启的服务器，也可在会话结束时自动回收本会话打开的连接。适合需要按任务启用不同 MCP 服务的 DSH 用户；服务器配置保存在本机状态文件中，运行服务器需要对应的本地命令或 HTTP 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:33-39","index.js:420-424","index.js:789-795","client.js:165-207"]}
{"unit_id":"yoyococo1234__dsh-plugin-mcp-switch#card-en","repo":"yoyococo1234/dsh-plugin-mcp-switch","commit":"40b349b49677cacb5f1c236427fa1471c26becd7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"MCP Switch manages MCP servers in DSH Web. Servers start disconnected to keep unused tools out of context. Agent tools and a Settings panel connect, disconnect, add, remove, and group servers. Startup policies restore or auto-start connections; sessions reclaim opened servers. Config stays local.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:33-39","index.js:789-795","index.js:372-385","client.js:165-207"]}
