{"unit_id":"yoyococo1234__dsh-plugin-mcp-switch#feature-1","repo":"yoyococo1234/dsh-plugin-mcp-switch","commit":"40b349b49677cacb5f1c236427fa1471c26becd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"MCP Switch 的功能「按需连接与断开」：通过 agent 工具或设置页切换单个或全部 MCP 服务器；连接后加载其工具，断开时卸载并释放对应上下文。连接有错误状态和结果反馈。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:468-556","client.js:79-112"]}
{"unit_id":"yoyococo1234__dsh-plugin-mcp-switch#feature-2","repo":"yoyococo1234/dsh-plugin-mcp-switch","commit":"40b349b49677cacb5f1c236427fa1471c26becd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"MCP Switch 的功能「服务器配置管理」：agent 可新增 stdio 或 streamable-http 服务器，指定命令、参数、环境变量或 URL 与请求头，也可删除配置；新增时可选择立即连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:560-659"]}
{"unit_id":"yoyococo1234__dsh-plugin-mcp-switch#feature-3","repo":"yoyococo1234/dsh-plugin-mcp-switch","commit":"40b349b49677cacb5f1c236427fa1471c26becd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"MCP Switch 的功能「启动与回收策略」：可选择启动时全部断开、恢复上次状态或只连接自启服务器，并设置会话结束时是否断开该会话打开的 MCP。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:298-321","index.js:357-385","index.js:662-713"]}
{"unit_id":"yoyococo1234__dsh-plugin-mcp-switch#feature-4","repo":"yoyococo1234/dsh-plugin-mcp-switch","commit":"40b349b49677cacb5f1c236427fa1471c26becd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"MCP Switch 的功能「服务器分组」：可保存、列出、删除服务器分组，并应用分组状态；应用时连接组内服务器并断开组外服务器。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:324-355","index.js:717-785"]}
{"unit_id":"yoyococo1234__dsh-plugin-mcp-switch#feature-5","repo":"yoyococo1234/dsh-plugin-mcp-switch","commit":"40b349b49677cacb5f1c236427fa1471c26becd7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"MCP Switch 的功能「上下文成本显示」：服务器连接后统计其注册工具 schema 的数量、字节数和估算 token 数，并在 agent 工具结果和设置页列表中展示。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:178-189","index.js:404-417","client.js:98-106"]}
